  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10 text-sm text-honeycomb-ink/70">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
      <span class="font-display font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-honeycomb-ink">
        Honeycomb Credit
      </span>
      <span>&copy; {year} Honeycomb Portal Inc. All rights reserved.</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl">
      Stories of real businesses that raised capital from their communities on
